---
// Old /scorecard/results?score=...&tier=...&name=... links carry the full
// results payload in the query string. Redirecting to bare '/score' (no
// query string) drops it and dumps the visitor on the generic landing page
// instead of their personalised results. Preserve it and route to the real
// results page instead.
return Astro.redirect(`/score/results${Astro.url.search}`, 301);
